<title>MAURITIUS: SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT MAURITIUS 3-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT MAURITIUS 3-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CUREPIPE, Mauritius 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mozambique beat</p>
<p>Mauritius 3-1 (halftime 2-0) in an African Nations Cup group</p>
<p>seven qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mozambique - Chiquinho Conde 6, Nuro Tualibudine 33, Manuel</p>
<p>Bucuane 89</p>
<p>Mauritius - Kersley Appou 65</p>
<p>Attendance: 700</p>
</text>
